# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 661b5fa1b6872a8a2e4d318141ea638bfb8cb28df2ed4f0b318ae9051cf604fb
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 1232e2ff13e7d4f10f1825f555e73463ef3a706deab9524864498f180ada19f5
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 5f549d70f11b9c6139259b75e0313186d9ed42b6ba3f3a3673a79b36b9be4eca
